OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighter heads to US to honour
OL,4,A9/11 colleagues
OL,5,
OL,6,FA firefighter is travelling to the
OL,7,FUnited States to take part in a
OL,8,Fchallenge to remember the crews who
OL,9,Fdied responding to the 9/11 terrorist
OL,10,Fattacks 25 years ago.
OL,12,FBristol Airport firefighter Lexi Grant,
OL,13,F27, is doing a stair climb at the
OL,14,FAtlanta Braves stadium on Saturday,
OL,15,Fcovering a distance equivalent to the
OL,16,Fheight of the 110 floors of the World
OL,17,FTrade Centre's Twin Towers.
OL,19,FShe will wear her full kit and carry
OL,20,Fthe name and photograph of one of the
OL,21,F343 New York firefighters who died on
OL,22,F11 September 2001.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
