OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighter heads to US to honour
OL,4,A9/11 colleagues
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrant was only two-years-old when
OL,7,Fhijackers flew jets into the two
OL,8,Fskyscrapers, and said she could not
OL,9,Fimagine what it would have been like
OL,10,Fhaving to climb so many floors and try
OL,11,Fto save people.
